OL,3,ARussian strikes cut power to thousands
OL,4,Ain Ukraine as Kherson ceasefire ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare humanitarian ceasefire in
OL,7,FUkraine's front-line Kherson region
OL,8,Fthat allowed civilians to evacuate the
OL,9,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky ended
OL,10,Fon Sunday night.
OL,12,FThe localised ceasefire was due to end
OL,13,Fat 22:59 Ukrainian time (21:00 GMT).
OL,14,FWhile the truce had held since it was
OL,15,Fimplemented last week, fighting had
OL,16,Fcontinued elsewhere.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
