OL,3,ARussian strikes cut power to thousands
OL,4,Ain Ukraine as Kherson ceasefire ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fsaid Russia had struck energy
OL,8,Finfrastructure in four regions
OL,9,Fovernight on Saturday, leaving hundreds
OL,10,Fof thousands of homes without power.
OL,11,FSome connections were restored on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FAnother overnight strike killed two
OL,15,Fpeople, including a 13-year-old girl,
OL,16,Fin the Vinnytsia region, the State
OL,17,FEmergency Service of Ukraine said.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
